OPTIMIZATION 4: "Campaign Restructuring"
- Better organize ad groups
- Improve campaign segmentation
- Adjust match types strategically
- Implement automated bidding where appropriate
Result: Better quality scores, lower costs

OPTIMIZATION 5: "Audience Targeting Refinement"
- Implement audience targeting
- Set up remarketing campaigns
- Create lookalike audiences
- Exclude audiences that don't convert
Result: Higher conversion rates, lower CAC

OPTIMIZATION 6: "Budget Reallocation"
- Move budget from losers to winners
- Identify most profitable campaigns
